 "answer_raw": "The newest model is the **iPhone Duo** (as of October 2026) [1].\n\nI didn't find the retail price for the iPhone Duo (check the Apple Store for current pricing) [1].\n\nUpgrading from an iPhone 14 to the iPhone Duo is a significant leap, but the value depends on whether you prioritize the latest hardware over the budget-friendly longevity of your current device. The iPhone 14 remains a capable device in 2026 with its A15 Bionic chip and enough iOS support to remain functional [2]. However, since the iPhone 14 is two generations behind the 16 and three behind the 17, moving to the Duo would provide the most substantial jump in performance, display, and features.",
